  m_Name: ApoLakay_Node_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueNode
  speakerName: APO LAKAY
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueText: 'To reach the Burnay pottery yard, you need to tell someone which
    direction to take.


    In Ilokano, ''agliko iti kannigid'' means ''turn left.''


    Use
    it when directing someone to turn toward the left side.


    Listen carefully:
    agliko iti kannigid.


    Now, try saying ''agliko iti kannigid'' yourself.'
